            play: "Raise it and hunters hound you; running is rarely worth it. Lower it and outsailing a hunter for an afternoon is enough to lose her.",
            history: "\"A stern chase is a long chase\": real ones lasted a day or more. The game cuts them short because a day of chasing is tedious to watch.",
