        hints: (
            does: "Water a ship's whole company pumps out each hour; fewer hands pump less. At today's values a full crew holds the leak until she's down to a fifth of her timbers.",
            play: "Raise it and only the worst-holed ships sink. Lower it and any damaged ship, even fully manned, is racing to port.",
